  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CHF (UNDP-MDTF) CAR CAP 2012</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CHF (UNDP-MTDF) CAR CAP 2012</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CHF-CAR st&#xF6;djer prioriterade projekt inom CAP:en 2012,enligt tv&#xE5; strategiska prioriteringar f&#xF6;r humanit&#xE4;ra insatser: i) Se till att personer som drabbats av konflikter och andra humanit&#xE4;ra kriser har tillg&#xE5;ng till grundl&#xE4;ggande service och fr&#xE4;mja respekten f&#xF6;r deras grundl&#xE4;ggande m&#xE4;nskliga r&#xE4;ttigheter; ii) St&#xE4;rka krisdrabbade personer motst&#xE5;ndskraft och inflytande</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CHF-CAR supports priority projects within the CAP: one in 2012, according to two strategic priorities for humanitarian action: i) ensure that the people affected by conflict and other humanitarian crises have access to basic services and to promote respect for their basic human rights, ii) Strengthen the resilience of the affected pop. and increase their influence</narrative>
  </description>
